# Pinnacle Starcage enters on turn 7 and exiles, together, every artifact and creature with mana value 2 or less whoever
# controls it: both players' Ornithopter (mana value 0) and Bot2's Dauthi Voidwalker (exactly 2). Barrowgoyf (exactly 3),
# the Starcage itself (3) and the lands stay: the boundary is "2 or less". Bot1's Moxen come down only after, so they
# are not exiled. On turn 9 {6}{W}{W} puts the three exiled cards into their owners' graveyards and makes one 2/2
# colorless Robot artifact creature token for each (CR 607.2a), under Bot1, then sacrifices the Starcage.
# CR 610.3 (until it leaves the battlefield), 202.3 (mana value), 111.1.

